{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/1/cf1f45b96b4abdf53471585a242d904ab3138166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(299)+3(299)+2(299)+298=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"264\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/6472090878bb664594942901914c28072db23d02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2889 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2989 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 2991 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 2999 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 3009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the distributive property, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5f04a922b4f0a302b9b400923c9ae1ea32a7c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(299)+3(299)+2(299)+298$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"247\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdb3bb2d4170a3138d100d7e727f79a558dd808c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 4(299)+3(299)+2(299)+1(299)-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"321\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e25856f5cf6f8c4221236c901b84d1bc72a385d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= (4+3+2+1)(299)-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"211\" height=\"20\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46bc0fd70f5818baaf604454bcda95d2df98debf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 10(299)-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22bd491fb74198c1cd61ad8a3db3f2a8da87a895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2989}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"103\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/